$ ./scripts/benchmark-email-podman.sh notes stalwart
Stalwart: modern integrated comparison target. Official Docker documentation
uses stalwartlabs/stalwart:latest and exposes SMTP/IMAP/admin ports. The v0.16
container starts in bootstrap mode when no generated setup config exists. Fair
SMTP/IMAP benchmarking still needs automated setup through the v0.16 management
API or stalwart-cli apply workflow.
